# HAT TRICK: proof that world 1's ten screens can be cleared, one after the
# other with the real flow between them (the clock, the food, the balloons):
# the demo player plays them with real presses, from 1-1 through
# the boss, with a few spare lives in hand.
game hattrick
wait 20
press A
wait 10
press A
wait 50
press A
wait 5
cheat level 1
cheat spare 0 9
botuntil level == 11 40000
print p0_deaths
print p0_score
expect p0_deaths <= 6
